_mps, implausible_wheel_accel_mps2, wheel_sigma_mps,\n    # process_accel_sigma_mps2, enable_adaptation.\n    # Train-only drive table is enabled by the node for vehicle_id=30618 and\n    # disabled for 30639; do not set a fixed boolean here, as it would override\n    # the vehicle-specific default. To override: enable_drive_table: false/true.\n    # Empty drive_table_path uses installed assets/drive_accel_table.csv.\n    # A missing or invalid file logs a startup warning and keeps physics-only\n    # prediction; check /result/diagnostics drive_table_active/used.\n",
